# Build context of showcase/frontends/nextjs/Dockerfile (the context is the repo
# root). This file replaces the root .dockerignore for that build.
#
# Send only what the image build reads. A change anywhere else, such as an
# integration's agent code, then does not invalidate the `next build` layer.
*

# The app.
!showcase/frontends/nextjs
# The target of the app's `_shared` symlink.
!showcase/integrations/_shared
# The registry generator and its inputs.
!showcase/scripts
!showcase/shared
!showcase/harness/package.json
!showcase/harness/src/shared
!showcase/integrations/*/manifest.yaml
!showcase/integrations/*/docs-links.json

# Local installs, build output and secrets inside the folders above. The image
# installs, generates and builds its own.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__
**/.DS_Store
showcase/frontends/nextjs/src/data
showcase/frontends/nextjs/next-env.d.ts
showcase/frontends/nextjs/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
showcase/frontends/nextjs/playwright-report
showcase/frontends/nextjs/test-results

# App files that the build does not read, so that a change to them does not
# start a new `next build`.
showcase/frontends/nextjs/Dockerfile
showcase/frontends/nextjs/Dockerfile.dockerignore
showcase/frontends/nextjs/project.json
showcase/frontends/nextjs/README.md
showcase/frontends/nextjs/scripts/e2e-local.sh
